Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.71,0:10:06.70,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Welcome to ProSeka AfterTalk: "We Escape to Survive" edition!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:17.54,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Um, kon-niigo, everyone! I'm Hinata Sato, the voice of Mizuki Akiyama from N25.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:23.66,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,This ProSeka AfterTalk is a program where we look back on the event story
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.66,0:10:27.92,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,and enjoy the AfterLive together with everyone watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.48,0:10:32.18,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,This time, we're covering the "We Escape to Survive" event.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.18,0:10:37.70,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It just ended yesterday, May 9th,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.70,0:10:43.60,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,so I hope you all enjoyed the story and the music!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.24,0:10:47.80,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I didn't realize the background would be this white,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.80,0:10:51.95,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,so wearing white today makes me look like a floating head,
Comment: 0,0:10:51.95,0:10:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,TODO: Insert "gachapin" reference photo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.95,0:10:55.52,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,like that Gachapin green screen fail.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.95,0:10:55.52,DefaultOnibe - TL Note,,0,0,0,,{\\pos(1100,40)}TL Note: Viral 2016 Japanese weather blooper where \Nmascot Gachapin vanished on green screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.52,0:10:59.75,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It looks like I'm filming a self-tape for an overseas audition or something,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.75,0:11:02.50,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,which is kind of funny, but getting back on track,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.50,0:11:08.40,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,the N25 story is really getting into some deep territory now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:11.02,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,so I hope you'll all look back on it with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.02,0:11:16.00,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,When you're posting your thoughts on the event or this stream,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:21.68,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,please use the hashtag #ProSekaAfterTalk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.68,0:11:24.00,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,The staff have set up the YouTube chat so I can see it right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.00,0:11:26.36,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,and I want to pick out some of your comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.36,0:11:27.96,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,"You're merging with the white."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:29.84,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I really am, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.60,0:11:31.28,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,"I love your bangs."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.28,0:11:31.96,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.07,0:11:33.57,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,There it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.64,0:11:35.64,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,"Surprisingly white."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.64,0:11:37.99,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's like a laundry detergent commercial.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:40.02,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.02,0:11:50.02,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Since Mizuki had straight hair this time, I decided to go with a sleek, straight look too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.02,0:11:50.98,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,"We get a great view of your mic."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.98,0:11:52.92,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,You get a great view of the mic and my face.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.92,0:11:55.02,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'd say it's a perfect composition.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:58.56,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'll keep picking up comments like this as we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.56,0:12:03.82,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Also, the staff have provided me with a device to use today.
Comment: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Card Illustrations ===
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.82,0:12:07.38,Mizuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,I'll be using it to show the new card illustrations we have for this event.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.38,0:12:10.40,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Also, for the AfterLive, I'm planning to create a private room
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.40,0:12:13.62,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,so I can enjoy it together with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.62,0:12:18.62,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'll be sharing the Room ID around 8:55 PM,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.62,0:12:23.28,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,so start warming up your fingers now so you can—
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:27.20,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,You'll want to enter the code as fast as you can so we can all watch the live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.20,0:12:29.00,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Please come and join me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.56,0:12:31.55,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Someone wrote, "There are 200 shades of white."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.52,0:12:35.34,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,That's right, there are 200 shades of white.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.34,0:12:36.24,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.76,0:12:44.12,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Anyway, I'd like to start looking back on the story of our event, "We Escape to Survive."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.58,0:12:53.82,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,This was sort of the Mizuki-perspective of the previous Kanade event story.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.82,0:12:57.78,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It wasn't so much about the plot moving forward,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.78,0:13:02.50,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,but more about showing Mizuki's perspective
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.50,0:13:07.72,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,after seeing what was happening with Kanade and Mafuyu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.60,0:13:12.70,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,But yeah, it's like...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.72,0:13:16.86,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Just having someone nearby who tells you it's okay to run away,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.86,0:13:19.12,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,it really puts your mind at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.12,0:13:27.45,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It made me realize how important it is to put those feelings into words.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.44,0:13:30.96,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,The recording was really pretty heavy, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:35.08,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I mean, when it comes to recording actually,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.08,0:13:39.10,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,unlike anime where you can record with others,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.10,0:13:41.96,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,for games like this, we usually record by ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.96,0:13:46.68,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Since I rarely get to hear what the others have recorded,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.68,0:13:50.72,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I didn't have a clear image of how the others would say their lines.
Comment: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:54.92,Default,,0,0,0,,TODO: Insert "Rui" image of Tanabe Rui
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.72,0:13:54.92,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Like, I didn't know how Rui-chan ended up performing her lines.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.92,0:13:58.50,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I had to use my imagination, so when I actually saw the event,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.50,0:14:02.18,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I was like, "Wow, everyone's acting is so good!"
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.18,0:14:07.48,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Like Ena, for example.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.48,0:14:10.00,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,If it were me, I'd probably just blurt things out,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.00,0:14:12.68,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,but Ena has this way of being persuasive yet firm.
Comment: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,TODO: Insert "Minori" image of Minori Suzuki
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.68,0:14:14.32,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Minori-chan is just amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.32,0:14:16.28,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,She was awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.28,0:14:19.64,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,This event really made me realize how much I love N25.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.64,0:14:25.28,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,If there are any scenes that left an impression on you, please let me know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.28,0:14:27.36,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Which episode stood out to you all?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.36,0:14:32.50,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Actually, we can watch one episode together right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.50,0:14:38.52,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,so please spam the chat with which one you want to see!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.52,0:14:39.28,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,4, 7...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.28,0:14:45.40,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,3, 7... Ah, it looks like 7 is the popular choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.96,0:14:49.88,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,The 7s are just flooding in now. 7, 7, 7... Okay, Episode 7 it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.48,0:14:51.76,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Sounds good.
Comment: 0,0:14:51.76,0:14:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Story Watchalong ===
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.76,0:14:58.52,Mizuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,Since there are a lot of requests for Episode 7, let's watch it together with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.52,0:14:59.02,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Comment: 0,0:30:01.87,0:30:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,~~~END STORY TALK~~~
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.87,0:30:08.48,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.48,0:30:09.54,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,That was nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.54,0:30:11.72,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It was really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.48,0:30:16.80,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I was thinking about this after watching the story again,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.80,0:30:21.04,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,but in past events, Mizuki has run away before,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.04,0:30:27.62,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,and while I feel like maybe some tend to think of running away as a bad thing,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.62,0:30:34.66,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,after talking to Luka-san and Len-kun, she realizes that running away isn't necessarily bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.66,0:30:39.00,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Instead of seeing it as running away,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.00,0:30:43.38,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,it's more like taking a break or a moment to catch your breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.38,0:30:49.94,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I think that was really the core of "We Escape to Survive."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.94,0:30:55.74,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Personally, if you asked me if I liked school—
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.74,0:31:01.08,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,in this line of work, I get asked a lot about what I was like as a student.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.08,0:31:05.88,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,To be honest, I don't have many good memories of my student days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.88,0:31:10.26,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Especially in middle school, I was already working in the entertainment industry,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.26,0:31:15.60,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,so I often had to leave school early, even though it was during compulsory education.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.60,0:31:23.92,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,So the teachers didn't look too kindly on it, and the kids around me could be quite cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.92,0:31:27.10,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I started to feel more detached and thinking
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.10,0:31:30.31,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,that maybe I didn't really have a place in middle school.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.31,0:31:34.20,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,But when I went to work, I felt like I truly loved what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.20,0:31:38.02,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I went to school and studied hard because I wanted to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.02,0:31:43.46,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Enjoying my time there motivated me to keep persevering at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.46,0:31:47.34,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,My workplace was the place where I belonged.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.34,0:31:51.50,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,That overlaps a bit with Mizuki.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.50,0:31:58.00,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I felt like even if things were tough, I'd be okay as long as I could keep doing my acting work.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.00,0:32:02.00,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,When I moved on to high school, it was a performing arts school,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.00,0:32:05.68,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,so everyone was doing the same kind of work.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.68,0:32:17.80,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,We thought alike, and that filter was gone, so it was much easier to breathe.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.80,0:32:22.12,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,And so... you don't have to think of running away as...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.12,0:32:25.44,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Some people might see "running away" literally as just running away.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.44,0:32:28.88,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,But you don't need to listen to those kinds of people.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.88,0:32:31.68,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,You don't have to care too much about other people's opinions.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.68,0:32:45.44,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Including all of that, I felt like this story really resonated with me and the way Mizuki lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.44,0:32:48.00,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Someone wrote that I'm very blunt. That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.92,0:32:52.12,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I figured once I graduate middle school, I'll never see them again anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.12,0:32:56.84,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,We have things like LINE and Twitter these days,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.84,0:33:00.92,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,but if you just delete them, it's like they never existed. You can just start over.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.92,0:33:03.62,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,You can rebuild your relationships from scratch.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.62,0:33:10.65,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,This is just my opinion, if it's really that painful, there are options like transferring schools.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.65,0:33:15.48,Mizuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,So it's not impossible to reset everything to zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.48,0:33:19.30,Mizuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,Once you graduate, if you don't stay in touch, the connection just fades.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.30,0:33:24.86,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,There are even shrines for cutting ties in Kyoto and places like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.86,0:33:28.50,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,So before things get really bad for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.50,0:33:32.31,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I think it's a good idea to broaden your horizons and look for a place to escape to.
Comment: 0,0:33:32.31,0:33:33.04,Mizuki,,0,0,0,,~~~Start AfterLive Watchalong~~~
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.04,0:33:39.80,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Anyway, from here, I'd like to watch the AfterLive together with everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.48,0:33:49.24,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,First, let me click this, and this, and this. Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.44,0:33:57.92,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'll create a private room so we can all watch together.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.92,0:34:03.76,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I've created the private room, so now I have to write down the code.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.68,0:34:05.52,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.20,0:34:14.28,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I have to be careful not to say it out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.32,0:34:20.96,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,This,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.17,0:34:24.67,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,and this,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.28,0:34:27.52,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,and this.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.84,0:34:47.18,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I wrote it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.18,0:34:50.76,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Is everyone ready to type in the code?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.36,0:34:52.56,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Someone wrote "I hope I can get in."
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.84,0:34:58.16,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,There's someone guessing the numbers based on how I'm writing them!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.76,0:35:01.96,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Zundamochi, that's not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.96,0:35:03.98,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I should have tried to hide it more.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.98,0:35:04.64,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.32,0:35:07.08,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Ten...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.40,0:35:13.40,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,...four.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.44,0:35:14.96,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.08,0:35:20.88,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Everyone, go ahead and join. Oh, the room is filling up fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.44,0:35:23.22,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Is it about time?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.22,0:35:23.96,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'll show it for a little bit longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.96,0:35:25.96,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,And they're all rushing in!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.20,0:47:43.32,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,That was a great AfterLive.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.32,0:47:49.82,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Considering what Mizuki said to Mafuyu at the end of the event, 
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.36,0:47:51.92,Mizuki,,0,0,0,,I'm really glad she came for the live.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.92,0:47:54.94,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Hearing them sing "Non-Breath Oblige" was so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.94,0:47:56.38,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It was great.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.38,0:47:57.67,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It was the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.64,0:48:00.82,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It was really wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.82,0:48:03.00,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Once again, thank you to everyone who joined the room,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.00,0:48:05.32,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,and everyone who enjoyed the stream with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.32,0:48:09.26,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm sorry if you got motion sickness from my weird camera angles.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.26,0:48:11.96,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you so much to everyone who watched.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.80,0:48:13.72,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.68,0:48:16.80,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,shall we move on?
Comment: 0,0:48:18.04,0:48:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Song Watchalong ===
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.04,0:48:22.20,Mizuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,And now, I'd like to watch the 2DMV for "Kitty"
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.20,0:48:26.40,Mizuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,that was released yesterday together with all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.40,0:48:33.22,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,This song was written for us by Tsumiki-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.22,0:48:35.51,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,But wasn't the full version just incredible?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.13,0:48:42.36,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,The slower tempo from the second verse onward is a classic Tsumiki-san move.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:43.37,0:48:47.28,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It's slightly different from the first verse, and that's what makes it so great.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.28,0:48:50.28,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I want to talk more about the music, but first,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.28,0:48:52.88,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'd like for us to watch the MV together.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.88,0:48:53.72,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Please take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:30.13,0:50:32.48,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,WAIT but the next part is so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.48,0:50:34.28,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Show us what comes next!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.28,0:50:35.44,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,The second verse so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.44,0:50:38.70,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Kanade singing "AM 1 o'clock" is so good!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.70,0:50:41.40,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,How the heck did Tomori-chan sing it like that this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:41.40,0:50:43.68,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I absolutely need them to release an Another Vocal version.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:43.68,0:50:45.20,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I really want to hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.20,0:50:49.82,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,How many different voices does Tomori-chan?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.56,0:50:51.84,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,She's truly amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.84,0:50:53.10,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'll have to ask Tomori-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.10,0:50:55.35,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll go to Tomori-chan's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:56.48,0:50:58.44,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll ask Tomori-chan about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.44,0:50:59.80,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It was really great.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.80,0:51:04.78,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It's written as "gozen ichiji" but sung as "AM 1 o'clock."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.78,0:51:06.24,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It's so cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.92,0:51:10.20,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I saw some people in the comments trying to read it as "25 o'clock"
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.20,0:51:13.32,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,and saying how cool it was, but I was like,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.32,0:51:17.46,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,"Actually, it's AM..."
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.46,0:51:22.56,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'd love for you to watch the full version on the official channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.56,0:51:27.00,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Actually, I wonder if I was the only one who got to record with Tsumiki-san in person?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:27.00,0:51:29.58,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if he recorded the other girls too.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.58,0:51:36.08,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,But he helped out with the direction. I remember him giving very specific nuances.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.08,0:51:41.52,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,For example, for the line "ajike no nai," I had my own way of saying it,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:41.52,0:51:48.18,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,but the sound Tsumiki-san had in his head was different from what I had in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.18,0:51:52.28,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,So for the "ajike no nai yoru ni toketa" line,
Dialogue: 0,0:51:52.28,0:51:56.48,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,he wanted me to sing the "ta" part with a descending feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:56.48,0:51:57.85,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I had to practice that a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.85,0:52:01.28,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I kept wanting to drop the pitch on "ajike no nai."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:01.28,0:52:03.30,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It was surprisingly difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.30,0:52:14.40,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,And for the "ha-ah-ah" part, I wanted to do it normally,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:14.40,0:52:21.38,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,but the direction was to make it really strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.38,0:52:27.48,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I wasn't even trying to growl, but after doing take after take,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.48,0:52:32.54,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I lost track of what I was doing, and one just happened to come out all raspy.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.54,0:52:36.88,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,They said, "That's great!" and that's the one they used.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.88,0:52:40.92,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I remember watching the MV and was like "oh wow, they went with that take".
Dialogue: 0,0:52:40.92,0:52:41.94,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It was tough.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.94,0:52:46.24,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,And for "kitty" especially, just catching the notes for was incredibly hard,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.16,0:52:49.68,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,so I had to slow it down... by how much?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:49.68,0:52:56.98,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Like 4 times slower to catch the melody for "jigetsu sae mo kodoku na tenge de."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.98,0:52:59.42,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Since I can't read sheet music, that's how I had to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:59.42,0:53:03.64,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Also, for the "meimei ni odore ya, one, two, three, four" part,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.64,0:53:07.98,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,there's a score for it, but the direction was to not sing it on pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.98,0:53:11.80,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,If everyone gets an Another Vocal version,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.80,0:53:16.56,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I guess the second verse won't be in it. Maybe I could specifically ask about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.56,0:53:20.48,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,but I'm really curious how everyone else said "one, two, three, four."
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.48,0:53:25.78,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It was more like a spoken line, and I was told not to worry about the notes at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.78,0:53:31.68,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm so curious how the others did it. I want to hear all four versions of that part.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:31.68,0:53:35.48,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,So that was "kitty." It really was the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:35.48,0:53:37.20,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I really want to sing it at karaoke.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:41.54,0:53:44.72,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,People are asking if everyone'll get an Another Vocal, but I just said "if" they do.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.72,0:53:46.82,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Please don't misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.82,0:53:48.84,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I don't know whose Another Vocal will be released.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.76,0:53:53.14,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,There's no one here for me to confirm with, so I really don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:53.80,0:53:57.83,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I hope you'll look forward to them being added later.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.80,0:54:02.64,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I want to hear Kanade's version, but I also really want to hear a Tomori Kusunoki version.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:03.20,0:54:06.20,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I seriously want to hear a Tomori-chan cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:06.20,0:54:08.10,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It would suit Tomori-chan so well.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.92,0:54:10.38,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm certain of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.00,0:54:15.42,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I hope everyone enjoys listening to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.42,0:54:18.00,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,We only showed a portion today,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:18.00,0:54:20.76,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,but the full version is up on the official ProSeka YouTube channel,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:20.76,0:54:23.96,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,so please be sure to check it out.
Comment: 0,0:54:23.96,0:54:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,corner,=== Corner: Card Illustrations ===
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.96,0:54:28.68,Mizuki,host_meta,0,0,0,,And we have five new cards added this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:28.68,0:54:31.88,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'd love to look at the illustrations and side stories—
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.88,0:54:32.88,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Oh sorry, not the side stories—
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.88,0:54:36.40,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'd like to cover the art. But did you all check out the side stories?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.40,0:54:39.28,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,They feel like a continuation of the event.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.28,0:54:45.92,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,This time especially, they show a bit of what was happening behind the scenes.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.11,0:54:49.88,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}So please do check them out if you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.88,0:54:52.26,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}but that depends on your gacha luck.
Comment: 0,0:54:52.26,0:54:52.88,DefaultOnibe - Shifted,,0,0,0,,Add some translation note that's shes talking about the team name
Dialogue: 0,0:54:52.88,0:54:55.09,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Speaking of which, where {\i1}is{\i0} my kitty?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.09,0:54:55.90,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She didn't wanna come.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.10,0:54:58.48,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}If wanted to spark for her...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.29,0:55:02.98,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}but I decided not to, so she never came.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.84,0:55:04.57,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}THE END.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.57,0:55:07.17,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Ok, so let's start with Ena then.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.17,0:55:10.65,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Ena's our 2-star this time. This is what she looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.65,0:55:13.12,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Actually, doesn't this kind of look like what Akito would wear?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:13.12,0:55:18.26,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I almost feel like... did she maybe borrow his clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.26,0:55:20.00,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I really do like this style though.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.00,0:55:24.55,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This might be the closest to what I actually wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.74,0:55:27.18,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}So that's Ena.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.18,0:55:28.17,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Moving on...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.17,0:55:29.88,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Len-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.88,0:55:32.52,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Starting with his untrained...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.52,0:55:33.65,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Is this so good!?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.65,0:55:36.94,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}You all should really go watch the side story for this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.94,0:55:38.84,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}But this is so good,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:38.84,0:55:41.86,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I love how you can tell Mizuki's kind of laughing like "hahaha..."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.23,0:55:46.18,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}he's not fully out of his shell,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.18,0:55:49.33,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}but seeing Len-kun open up just a little like this is suuuuuper cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.33,0:55:50.18,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Love it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:50.99,0:55:53.11,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And next up...
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.11,0:55:56.11,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Are there even any working phone booths out there anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.91,0:55:59.74,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}The boxes themselves are mostly gone too, so where the heck is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.74,0:56:01.42,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}He's not in the city anymore, is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.42,0:56:03.90,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Where—seriously, where are you taking this call from?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.90,0:56:06.68,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Be careful with calls that late at night!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.68,0:56:07.75,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}They can't be up to any good!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.75,0:56:10.38,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I wanna go and make sure he's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:10.38,0:56:11.47,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}So cute~
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.47,0:56:12.20,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I guess he's hiding from the rain in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.20,0:56:15.20,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}He's holding the receiver, so I really want him to call me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.60,0:56:19.82,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I bet he hasn't used a telephone card, has he?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.82,0:56:21.86,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I used to have a telephone card.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.86,0:56:24.13,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I'm becoming an old Heisei lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:24.73,0:56:25.61,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Moving on...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.00,0:56:28.80,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}let's start with the untrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.80,0:56:33.22,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Very very nice if I do say so myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:34.77,0:56:37.53,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Was it three? Three 4-stars this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.53,0:56:39.25,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}But Mizuki still didn't come home—
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.25,0:56:40.60,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This is super good though.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.60,0:56:42.09,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Luka's nails are really pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:44.05,0:56:45.76,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And this is the trained.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.76,0:56:49.67,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}She reminds me a bit of Mizuki herself here.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.67,0:56:51.21,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I really like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.44,0:56:53.59,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}But, uh, where is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:54.96,0:56:57.69,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It's raining pretty hard. Careful not to catch a cold!
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.24,0:57:00.96,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}These are all so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:00.96,0:57:02.98,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}"Luka-san trained art is so cute."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.98,0:57:04.92,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.92,0:57:06.98,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}So cyute 🤌
Dialogue: 0,0:57:06.98,0:57:08.81,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}What can I say but "thank you."
Dialogue: 0,0:57:08.81,0:57:09.73,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}You're up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:09.73,0:57:10.63,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Look at it!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.62,0:57:13.80,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This is the untrained.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.80,0:57:15.97,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This art though...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.97,0:57:19.11,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}When Mafumom went "I just threw out your synthesizer. ¯\_(ツ)_/¯"
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.19,0:57:22.14,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}"Whoops, I broke your laptop. ¯\_(ツ)_/¯"
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.14,0:57:23.57,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This looks like it's from that moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.03,0:57:26.27,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.27,0:57:30.76,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Like, you can see the light coming from behind the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.76,0:57:34.01,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It's such an eerie glow,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.01,0:57:37.55,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I feel like I've only seen this kind of lighting in horror games.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:39.16,0:57:44.13,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And they even have the flowers in the front...
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.13,0:57:46.09,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It really does give kind of a horror vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:46.94,0:57:48.84,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And the trained—
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.84,0:57:51.15,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Look, everyone, she's holding the umbrella! The umbrella!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:52.06,0:57:53.29,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}The umbrella!
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.29,0:57:54.93,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:54.93,0:57:57.25,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And look, the background is a bit different from Luka's.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.25,0:58:00.15,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Kind of looks like maybe this is from somewhere close to Luka's spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.15,0:58:02.25,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I really like this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.00,0:58:06.14,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I also really like seeing the alternate hairstyles.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:06.14,0:58:10.50,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I think, was it in the second verse of "kitty",
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.50,0:58:13.28,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}the MV changes between Mizuki and her middle school self.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.28,0:58:14.36,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}That was super cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:14.36,0:58:18.48,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Ah, seeing the alternate hairstyles here is awesome. Thank you staff.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.68,0:58:21.77,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And last up.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.77,0:58:26.18,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Starting with the untrained, we just saw this in Episode 7 of the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.18,0:58:33.10,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}This is the scene when Mizuki tells Mafuyu that it's okay to run away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.97,0:58:36.39,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I've only seen this kind of shot in dramas,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.39,0:58:37.82,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}kind of like it's in slow motion,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.82,0:58:39.39,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}when the background blends together,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:39.39,0:58:43.08,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}and when it focuses on Mizuki like this,\Nyou know she's gonna drop some wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.08,0:58:44.77,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:45.84,0:58:48.21,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}If I keep looking at this, I'm gonna fall in love.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:48.21,0:58:49.06,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:49.46,0:58:52.72,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}And the trained version is also amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.72,0:58:55.88,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I don't know if it's because she's wearing a cap,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:55.88,0:58:59.29,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}but she's like, "Here, take the umbrella."
Dialogue: 0,0:58:59.29,0:59:02.29,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}But showing that much collarbone must be freezing!
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.36,0:59:07.44,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}If I didn't know any better, I definitely Mizuki should be holding it for herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.44,0:59:10.87,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}But if I were Mafuyu, I'd probably just accept it.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:10.87,0:59:11.67,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.67,0:59:12.53,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}So cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:12.53,0:59:14.06,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.06,0:59:17.64,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}But where are they anyway? Look at the background...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:18.20,0:59:19.11,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Everything's destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.52,0:59:24.34,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It feels like they're in a post-apocalyptic world sharing that umbrella together.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.34,0:59:25.58,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}It's so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:25.58,0:59:26.72,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Truly.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.72,0:59:27.80,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you for the feast.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:28.44,0:59:29.92,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}A huge thank you for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.92,0:59:32.16,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}They didn't come home to my account, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.16,0:59:35.70,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}But maybe if I give it time, they'll show up eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.70,0:59:37.32,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I'll keep waiting and believing that.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.32,0:59:38.78,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}That's what I'm thinking.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:38.78,0:59:45.78,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Seriously, the ProSeka team goes full throttle with every single illustration.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.78,0:59:47.88,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Do they even get any sleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.88,0:59:49.38,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}All their art is just that good.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:49.38,0:59:52.44,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I'm always so grateful whenever I pull on the gacha.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.44,0:59:53.86,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:53.86,0:59:57.96,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I hope you all manage to get it too! Oh, wait, was this a limited card?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.96,0:59:58.60,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Right...
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.60,1:00:01.32,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Goodbye, "kitty"...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:01.32,1:00:02.95,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.80,1:00:06.40,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}I'll look forward to when the limited cards come back around again.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.35,1:00:08.20,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Bye bye...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.72,1:00:11.25,PiP,,0,0,0,,{\pos(650,750)}Anyway, that's it for that part.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.25,1:00:16.48,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,We got to see many different aspects of this event today.
Comment: 0,1:00:16.48,1:00:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,~~CLOSEOUT~~
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.48,1:00:23.86,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It was a short time, but that's all for ProSeka AfterTalk: We Escape to Survive edition!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.86,1:00:26.78,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,How did everyone watching the stream enjoy it?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.78,1:00:29.76,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Someone wrote, "See you again in a year!"
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.76,1:00:31.24,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,The gacha is still running right now.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.12,1:00:34.68,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I've pulled halfway to sparking.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.68,1:00:36.40,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm at 150 pulls, but...
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.04,1:00:39.59,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Should I do another 150?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.55,1:00:42.88,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,At that point, I'm kind of going all in.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.88,1:00:44.19,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Am I really going to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.78,1:00:47.08,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,"I had a lot of fun!"
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.08,1:00:48.30,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.30,1:00:49.42,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,There are still 15 hours left.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:49.42,1:00:51.32,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,If you haven't pulled them yet, you still have 15 hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.32,1:00:52.17,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.36,1:00:55.20,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,The event was great, of course,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.00,1:01:01.76,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,but "kitty", which you're hearing now, is one of my absolute favorites from N25.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:01.76,1:01:08.42,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It's the same for every unit, but I can immediately tell who is singing which part.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.42,1:01:13.45,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Everyone has their own quirks and different approaches to the songs.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.45,1:01:16.20,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,So when I hear the complete version with everyone,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.20,1:01:18.94,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I hear approaches I never would've thought of.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.94,1:01:23.00,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,And of course the Virtual Singers are there too,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:23.00,1:01:27.88,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'm always amazed by how good everyone's singing is.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.48,1:01:33.40,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I feel so grateful to everyone in N25 every day.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.40,1:01:38.48,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Talking with all of you and looking back on this event together has been so much fun for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.66,1:01:43.02,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,And if any of you listening felt like at some point you couldn't run away,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.02,1:01:46.50,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I hope watching this AfterTalk and event story
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.50,1:01:49.92,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,helps you say something kind to the person you were back then.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.92,1:01:54.76,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Whether you're a student or anyone who feels like they have no place to escape to right now,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.76,1:02:03.22,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,reaching out and asking someone for help is a big first step.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.22,1:02:07.56,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I'd be happy if this event could help you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.56,1:02:13.76,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,So, if you haven't finished the story for "We Escape to Survive" yet,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.76,1:02:19.60,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,you can read it all in the Event Stories menu once the next event starts.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.60,1:02:26.24,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,And if you've already read it, I hope you'll enjoy it again and again!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.08,1:02:33.78,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Also, in just three months, before you know it, it'll be Mizuki's birthday!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.78,1:02:39.42,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,The change in seasons means the temperature is fluctuating like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:39.42,1:02:45.22,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,So stay warm or cool as needed, listen to your body,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.22,1:02:47.84,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,I hope you all stay healthy.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:47.84,1:02:51.96,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,It was a short time, but thank you so much for joining me!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:51.96,1:02:54.10,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Well then, I'll see you all again!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.10,1:02:55.90,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Otsu-niigo!
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.90,1:02:57.16,Mizuki,host,0,0,0,,Bye bye!
